passives.desc:
The <k>Detection Core</k> created by the Elemental Skill <k>Principle: Variable Detection</k> is enhanced. Depending on the state of the <k>Detection Core</k> created:
· Steady State: All nearby party members gain 30 Elemental Mastery for each <k>Gradient Beacon</k> Mitya has;
· Overloaded: After nearby party members trigger Stellar-Conduct reactions, instead obtain 1 <k>Gradient Beacon</k> every 1.5s for 6s.
